v><!--]--></a><!--]--></div><div class="drop-item" data-v-14f1ffee><!--[--><a href="/colleges/bse" class="p-2 pl-4 flex items-start space-x-4 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-100 transition ease-in-out duration-150" title="Berkeley School of Education" data-v-14f1ffee><!--[--><div class="space-y-1" data-v-14f1ffee><span class="item-link leading-6" data-v-14f1ffee>Berkeley School of Education</span></div><!--]--></a><!--]--></div><div class="drop-item" data-v-14f1ffee><!--[--><a href="/colleges/haas" class="p-2 pl-4 flex items-start space-x-4 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-100 transition ease-in-out duration-150" title="Haas School of Business" data-v-14f1ffee><!--[--><div class="space-y-1" data-v-14f1ffee><span class="item-link leading-6" data-v-14f1ffee>Haas School of Business</span></div><!--]--></a><!--]--></div><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></div></div></li><!--]--></ul></nav><!----></div></div></aside></div><span></span><span class="visually-hidden" role="status"><!----></span><div id="main-content" role="main" class="flex-grow"><!--[--><div class="max-w-screen-xl mx-auto flex justify-center flex-col px-4 lg:flex-row md:pt-12 pt-0 md:pb-8 outline-none" page data-v-9071ec37 data-v-516c3887><section tabindex="-1" class="lg:w-2/3 w-full content-container theme-page-content pb-0" aria-label="Page content" data-v-516c3887><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><div aria-live="polite" class="visually-hidden" data-v-9071ec37> Navigated to College of Engineering. </div><h1 data-v-9071ec37>College of Engineering</h1><div class="" data-v-9071ec37><!--[--><div class="relative grid mt-12 mb-8" data-test="horizontal-scroll" data-v-9071ec37 data-v-44aefb4a><button aria-hidden="true" aria-label="Scroll tabs left" data-test="left-scroll-button" class="absolute bg-white rounded-full border left-0 btn-left flex items-center justify-center" style="display:none;" data-v-44aefb4a><svg class="svg-inline--fa fa-angle-left fa-w-8 text-gray-600" style="" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="angle-left" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 512" data-v-44aefb4a><path class="" style="" fill="currentColor" d="M31.7 239l136-136c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l22.6 22.6c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L127.9 256l96.4 96.4c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L201.7 409c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-136-136c-9.5-9.4-9.5-24.6-.1-34z"></path></svg></button><div data-test="scroll-wrapper" class="overflow-x-auto overflow-y-hidden scroll-wrapper" data-v-44aefb4a><!--[--><div class="flex w-full tab-list" role="tablist" data-v-9071ec37><!--[--><div class="mr-1 flex-shrink-0 w-auto text-center list-item" data-v-9071ec37><a aria-current="page" href="/colleges/engineering" class="router-link-active router-link-exact-active bg-white inline-block px-2 md:px-4 text-blue-600 font-semibold ui-font my-1 underline" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="tab-content-panel" role="tab" data-v-9071ec37>College of Engineering</a></div><div class="mr-1 flex-shrink-0 w-auto text-center list-item" data-v-9071ec37><a aria-current="page" href="/colleges/engineering#admissions" class="router-link-active router-link-exact-active bg-white inline-block px-2 md:px-4 text-blue-600 font-semibold ui-font my-1" aria-selected="false" role="tab" data-v-9071ec37>Admissions</a></div><div class="mr-1 flex-shrink-0 w-auto text-center list-item" data-v-9071ec37><a aria-current="page" href="/colleges/engineering#advising1" class="router-link-active router-link-exact-active bg-white inline-block px-2 md:px-4 text-blue-600 font-semibold ui-font my-1" aria-selected="false" role="tab" data-v-9071ec37>Advising</a></div><div class="mr-1 flex-shrink-0 w-auto text-center list-item" data-v-9071ec37><a aria-current="page" href="/colleges/engineering#academic-opportunities" class="router-link-active router-link-exact-active bg-white inline-block px-2 md:px-4 text-blue-600 font-semibold ui-font my-1" aria-selected="false" role="tab" data-v-9071ec37>Academic Opportunities</a></div><div class="mr-1 flex-shrink-0 w-auto text-center list-item" data-v-9071ec37><a aria-current="page" href="/colleges/engineering#contact-information1" class="router-link-active router-link-exact-active bg-white inline-block px-2 md:px-4 text-blue-600 font-semibold ui-font my-1" aria-selected="false" role="tab" data-v-9071ec37>Contact Information</a></div><!--]--></div><!--]--></div><button aria-hidden="true" aria-label="Scroll tabs right" data-test="right-scroll-button" class="absolute bg-white rounded-full border right-0 btn-right flex items-center justify-center" style="display:none;" data-v-44aefb4a><svg class="svg-inline--fa fa-angle-right fa-w-8 text-gray-600" style="" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-prefix="fas" data-icon="angle-right" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 512" data-v-44aefb4a><path class="" style="" fill="currentColor" d="M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z"></path></svg></button></div><!--]--><section id="tab-content-panel" role="tabpanel" data-v-9071ec37 data-v-49e84bf7><article class="main-content" data-test="rich-content" data-v-49e84bf7><h1>Introduction to the College</h1><p>At the core of the College of Engineering's mission are values that drive us to educate inclusive leaders and create knowledge equitably in service of a diverse society.</p><p>There are many reasons why Berkeley Engineering is ranked among the top three engineering schools in the world:</p><ul><li><p>We offer a dynamic, interdisciplinary, hands-on education.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p>We challenge conventional thinking and value creativity and imagination.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p>Our students and faculty are driven by social commitment and want to change the world.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p>We are a village of entrepreneurs and collaborators within the big city of a renowned public university.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p>We make a world of difference.</p></li></ul><p><a href="https://nextguide.berkeley.edu/undergraduate/degree-programs/?filter_2=true" target="_blank" class="open_in_new_tab" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"><u>Explore majors and minors</u></a> available through the College of Engineering.</p><p><a href="http://coe.berkeley.edu/" target="_blank" class="open_in_new_tab" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"><strong>Visit the College of Engineering Website</strong></a></p></article><!--[--><!----><!--]--></section></div><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></section></div><!--]--></div><div class="color-theme-footer-font bg-theme-darkest pb-7 pt-8 flex-no-shrink" data-v-f17fdb7b><div class="max-w-screen-xl px-4 mx-auto flex flex-col" data-v-f17fdb7b><!----><div class="flex pt-4 mx-4 mt-4" data-v-f17fdb7b><div class="flex-col w-1/2" data-v-f17fdb7b><div class="container" data-v-f17fdb7b><div class="w-full text-xs mb-3"><!----></div></div></div><div class="flex-col w-1/2 self-center" data-v-f17fdb7b><div class="container" data-v-f17fdb7b><div class="text-right w-full text-xs mb-3"> Powered by <a href="https://www.coursedog.com" target="_blank" class="ml-1 underline" rel="noopener"> Coursedog </a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><footer id="site-footer">
